The full Fava commit history is preserved in this repository. Favabooks adds
bookkeeping screens on top of Fava (see frontend/src/qb/ and
src/fava/qb_api.py); everything else is Fava's work.

Favabooks is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Fava or Beancount
projects, or by Intuit. "QuickBooks" is a trademark of Intuit Inc. and is
used here only to describe the style of workflow.

The Python package and command keep Fava's name (`fava`) so upstream changes
can be merged. Favabooks is not published to PyPI.
